%description:
Light uplink traffic over RLC AM from UEs on two narrow carriers is delivered in full: a UE
granted on both carriers in one slot sends each carrier's data in that carrier's MAC PDU, also
when its RLC entity has nothing to send for one of the requests.

One gNB on two carriers of 6 bands each, and four UEs in front of it, each with an acknowledged
mode bearer. From 0.1 s to 0.8 s each UE sends the server 2000 bytes every 20 ms; a packet does
not fit the bands of one carrier, so a UE is granted on both. The run goes on to 1 s so that the
queues drain.

Checked: the run ends at its time limit, and the server receives every byte each UE sent,
72 000 bytes.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork
sim-time-limit = 1s

*.numUe = 4
*.*.app[*].**.scalar-recording = true
**.numBands = 6
*.carrierAggregation.numComponentCarriers = 2
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].carrierFrequency = 2GHz
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1].carrierFrequency = 3.5GHz
*.gnb.cellularNic.numCarriers = 2
*.gnb.cellularNic.phy.componentCarrierModules = "carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0] carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1]"
*.ue[*].cellularNic.nrPhy.componentCarrierModules = "carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0] carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1]"
*.bearerConfigurator.onDemandDrbs = [{coreNetwork: "5gc", isDefault: true, suppressSdapHeader: true, lcg: 3, rlcMode: "AM"}]

# uplink: ue[i].app[0] to server.app[i]
*.server.numApps = 4
*.ue[*].numApps = 1
*.ue[*].app[0].typename = "CbrSender"
*.ue[*].app[0].destAddress = "server"
*.ue[*].app[0].destPort = 2000 + ancestorIndex(1)
*.server.app[*].typename = "CbrReceiver"
*.server.app[*].localPort = 2000 + ancestorIndex(0)
*.*.app[*].packetSize = 2000B
*.*.app[*].startTime = 0.1s
*.*.app[*].finishTime = 0.8s
*.ue[*].app[0].samplingTime = 20ms

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Simulation time limit reached
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar NrSessionTestNetwork.server.app[0] cbrReceivedBytes:sum 72000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar NrSessionTestNetwork.server.app[1] cbrReceivedBytes:sum 72000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar NrSessionTestNetwork.server.app[2] cbrReceivedBytes:sum 72000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar NrSessionTestNetwork.server.app[3] cbrReceivedBytes:sum 72000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
